```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Docker as Docker Compose
    participant Build as Image Builder
    participant Registry as Image Registry (Optional)
    participant Network as Docker Networks
    participant Volumes as Docker Volumes
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant ClickHouse as ClickHouse
    participant MinIO as MinIO
    participant RabbitMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Migrate as Migrate Service
    participant Backend as Backend API
    participant Worker as Worker Service
    participant Scheduler as Scheduler Service
    participant Frontend as Frontend
    participant Proxy as Proxy
    participant Cloudflared as Cloudflared

    Note over Dev,Cloudflared: Build Phase
    Dev->>Docker: docker compose -f docker-prod.yaml build
    Docker->>Build: Build Frontend Image
    Build->>Build: Install Dependencies
    Build->>Build: Build React App
    Build->>Build: Create Distroless Nginx Image
    Build-->>Docker: Frontend Image Ready
    
    Docker->>Build: Build Backend Image
    Build->>Build: Install Dependencies
    Build->>Build: Generate Prisma Client
    Build->>Build: Build TypeScript
    Build-->>Docker: Backend Image Ready
    
    Docker->>Build: Build Worker/Scheduler/Migrate Images
    Build-->>Docker: Service Images Ready
    
    Docker->>Build: Build Proxy Image
    Build->>Build: Extract Nginx Dependencies
    Build->>Build: Create Distroless Image
    Build-->>Docker: Proxy Image Ready
    
    Note over Docker,Volumes: Infrastructure Setup
    Docker->>Network: Create backend Network (192.168.250.0/24)
    Docker->>Network: Create frontend Network (192.168.251.0/24)
    Docker->>Network: Create public Network (192.168.252.0/24)
    Docker->>Volumes: Create backtrade_db Volume
    Docker->>Volumes: Create backtrade_minio_data Volume
    Docker->>Volumes: Create backtrade_clickhouse_data Volume
    Docker->>Volumes: Create backtrade_rabbitmq_data Volume
    
    Note over Docker,Postgres: Service Startup Phase 1: Infrastructure
    Docker->>Postgres: Start Container
    Postgres->>Postgres: Initialize Database
    Postgres->>Postgres: Run Health Check (pg_isready)
    Postgres-->>Docker: Healthy
    
    Docker->>Redis: Start Container
    Redis->>Redis: Initialize Cache
    Redis->>Redis: Run Health Check (redis-cli ping)
    Redis-->>Docker: Healthy
    
    Docker->>ClickHouse: Start Container
    ClickHouse->>ClickHouse: Initialize Analytics DB
    ClickHouse->>ClickHouse: Run Health Check (wget /ping)
    ClickHouse-->>Docker: Healthy
    
    Docker->>MinIO: Start Container
    MinIO->>MinIO: Initialize Object Storage
    MinIO->>MinIO: Run Health Check (curl /health/live)
    MinIO-->>Docker: Healthy
    
    Docker->>RabbitMQ: Start Container
    RabbitMQ->>RabbitMQ: Initialize Message Queue
    RabbitMQ->>RabbitMQ: Run Health Check (rabbitmq-diagnostics ping)
    RabbitMQ-->>Docker: Healthy
    
    Note over Docker,Migrate: Phase 2: Database Migration
    Docker->>Migrate: Start Container (depends_on: postgres, clickhouse healthy)
    Migrate->>Postgres: Run Prisma Migrations
    Migrate->>ClickHouse: Run ClickHouse Migrations
    Migrate-->>Docker: Completed Successfully (exit 0)
    
    Note over Docker,Scheduler: Phase 3: Application Services
    Docker->>Backend: Start Container (depends_on: migrate completed, others healthy)
    Backend->>Backend: Start Express Server
    Backend->>Backend: Run Health Check (/api/v1/health)
    Backend-->>Docker: Healthy
    
    Docker->>Worker: Start Container (depends_on: migrate completed, others healthy)
    Worker->>Worker: Connect to RabbitMQ
    Worker->>Worker: Start Job Consumer
    Worker-->>Docker: Running
    
    Docker->>Scheduler: Start Container (depends_on: migrate completed, others healthy)
    Scheduler->>Scheduler: Start Cron Jobs
    Scheduler->>Scheduler: Start Retry Handler
    Scheduler-->>Docker: Running
    
    Note over Docker,Cloudflared: Phase 4: Frontend Services
    Docker->>Frontend: Start Container (depends_on: backend started)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Start Nginx Server
    Frontend-->>Docker: Running
    
    Docker->>Proxy: Start Container (depends_on: frontend started, backend healthy)
    Proxy->>Proxy: Start Nginx Reverse Proxy
    Proxy-->>Docker: Running
    
    Note over Docker,Cloudflared: Phase 5: External Access
    Docker->>Cloudflared: Start Container (no dependencies)
    Cloudflared->>Cloudflared: Connect to Cloudflare
    Cloudflared->>Cloudflared: Run Health Check (tunnel info)
    Cloudflared-->>Docker: Healthy
    
    Note over Dev,Cloudflared: Deployment Complete
    Docker-->>Dev: All Services Running
    Dev->>Docker: docker compose ps (Verify Status)
    Docker-->>Dev: Service Status Report
```
